                            POSSESSIONS			
|YK0================================================================|YKB
	
'A Monk needs not these things..'- |RKBMaster Vio to Master Angst
all the time
|YK0
A monk has no need for material wealth. Gold should be donated
to Maelstrom. It only confuses the mind.

A monk needs not own a boat. They are a perversion of the
natural order. 

A monk needs not own a business. Living life is a business in
itself.

A monk needs only his robe and stick. Warmth and defence they
provide.

|YK0================================================================
